====================================================================================================
B1. Sym Q = P_rho + K_rho exactly: True
B2. K_b = S_b - b exactly (so b = S_b - K_b and K_eff = K_rho + D_R - K_b): True
B3. <(S_b + P_rho) phi, phi> = int [R1phi, R2phi] M_R [R1phi, R2phi]^T exactly: True ; sum ||R_j phi||^2 = ||phi||^2: True
